  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_01",
      "hash64": "D8EAE990BCF2D5B0",
      "text": "哈啊！给我好好看看！\\n极地广场的对战场～！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_02",
      "hash64": "D8EAEC90BCF2DAC9",
      "text": "……不过，这里除了特别冷以外，\\n和其他区也差不多啦！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_03",
      "hash64": "D8EAEB90BCF2D916",
      "text": "我虽然是驯龙师，\\n但还挺喜欢寒冷的。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_04",
      "hash64": "D8EAEE90BCF2DE2F",
      "text": "哎呀，话说回来，[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]哥姐们，\\n你是为四天王挑战来的啊。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_05",
      "hash64": "D8EAED90BCF2DC7C",
      "text": "我这里的挑战是\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]巨蛋限定对战[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_06",
      "hash64": "D8EAF090BCF2E195",
      "text": "规则非常简单！\\n只要你打赢联盟社的３名后辈，\\r\\n挑战就算完事啦！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_07",
      "hash64": "D8EAEF90BCF2DFE2",
      "text": "不过，正如其名～！\\n对战的宝可梦得符合条件才行！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_10",
      "hash64": "D8E78490BCEFF43A",
      "text": "其一！必须是在[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]生态巨蛋[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]捕捉的[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]野生宝可梦！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_12",
      "hash64": "D8E78290BCEFF0D4",
      "text": "其二！必须是[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]自己[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]捕捉的[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]宝可梦！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_13",
      "hash64": "D8E78390BCEFF287",
      "text": "要是同行队伍中有不符合\\n条件的宝可梦，就不能挑战哦。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_14",
      "hash64": "D8E78090BCEFED6E",
      "text": "虽然这可能有点麻烦，\\n但如果用你的大笔积蓄\\r\\n轻松打赢也没什么意思嘛！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_15",
      "hash64": "D8E78190BCEFEF21",
      "text": "当然，对手也会以相同的条件努力对战，\\n所以你也配合一下咯。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_16",
      "hash64": "D8E77E90BCEFEA08",
      "text": "那好～[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]哥姐们，\\n要开始四天王挑战吗！？[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_select_01",
      "hash64": "2F6D9CFA77AE15BD",
      "text": "我要挑战！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_select_02",
      "hash64": "2F6D99FA77AE10A4",
      "text": "听说明",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_select_03",
      "hash64": "2F6D9AFA77AE1257",
      "text": "下次吧",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_17",
      "hash64": "D8E77F90BCEFEBBB",
      "text": "嗯！那好～\\n后辈们～出来吧～！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_all_01",
      "hash64": "C7BA86F4AC3BE73F",
      "text": "　　　　　　请多关照！\\n请多指教～！　　　　　多多关照啦！[VAR 0x0114(004D)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004D"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_18",
      "hash64": "D8E77C90BCEFE6A2",
      "text": "我的挑战\\n以悠～闲为宗旨。[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_19",
      "hash64": "D8E77D90BCEFE855",
      "text": "想马上开始对战\\n也没问题！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_20",
      "hash64": "D8E3FE90BCECDAB1",
      "text": "想在巨蛋逛，捕捉宝可梦\\n也没问题！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_21",
      "hash64": "D8E3FD90BCECD8FE",
      "text": "那好～放轻松！\\n双方都好好加油吧～[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_dragonbb_npc",
      "hash64": "9FCE05EF699E9EFA",
      "text": "马上开始对战，或是换个心情\\n随便去哪逛逛都没问题！\\r\\n悠～闲地好好加油吧～[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_a_01",
      "hash64": "60B74CB7C5C4B4DF",
      "text": "我最喜欢茶色的宝可梦了！\\n你要和我对战吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_a_04",
      "hash64": "60B747B7C5C4AC60",
      "text": "哎呀～你的宝可梦\\n好像不符合条件呀！\\c\\n你能带来的宝可梦仅限\\n在生态巨蛋！自己捕捉的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_a_02",
      "hash64": "60B74DB7C5C4B692",
      "text": "好嘞～！请多指教～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_a_03",
      "hash64": "60B74EB7C5C4B845",
      "text": "剩下的对战你也好好加油！\\n我会给你送上茶色的助威哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_b_01",
      "hash64": "377F54C3104234C8",
      "text": "我是个冷酷的女人……\\n你做好……颤抖的准备了吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_b_04",
      "hash64": "377F59C310423D47",
      "text": "咦？你的宝可梦\\n好像不符合条件哦。\\c\\n你需要带来的宝可梦仅限\\n在生态巨蛋！自己捕捉的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_b_02",
      "hash64": "377F57C3104239E1",
      "text": "呵呵……请多关照！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_b_03",
      "hash64": "377F56C31042382E",
      "text": "不畏寒冷地加油吧，\\n我会为你送上冷酷的助威……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_c_01",
      "hash64": "638660C971AC4DDD",
      "text": "你知道奇树这个直播主吗？\\n我和她用相同的属性对战哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_c_04",
      "hash64": "63865BC971AC455E",
      "text": "你的宝可梦\\n好像不符合条件哟。\\c\\n你要带来的宝可能只能是\\n在生态巨蛋！自己捕捉的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_d_02_enemy_c_02",
